        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCLYO19ENTR, Arc Tall Plate Entrance Set with Lyon Glass Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you want to jazz up your historic building and breathe new life into your front door, the Black Lyon Knob with Arc Tall Plate Entryset is the cat's pajamas. This 1920's-esque Arc Tall Plate Entrance Set with Lyon Glass Knob is a single cylinder lock, great for adding security and style. The Grandeur Lyon Knob with Arc Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock comes in a wide array of finish colors for the backplate--all of which off-set the black glass knob in the most alluring way. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/lyon-black-glass-knob-with-arc-plate-grandeur-arclyo19\"><b>Lyon Knob with Arc Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Lyon Knob with Arc Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Lyon Black Glass Knob with Arc Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Glass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.11\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCLYO19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262395\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCLYO19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
